    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38297" root="مخط" body-key="m">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">امتخط</span></b>  <i>He blew his nose; ejected the mucus
from his nose;</i> (S, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تمخّط</span></b> :
(S, K:) or the latter signifies <i>he had the mucus
removed from out of his nose.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also 1, in three places.

